fixture cam_fall_toss_teleport
doc Camera review round 2: walk off the high shelf, throw the ember sideways at terminal speed and teleport back up to it 8 ticks later (a short teleport, no cut), then keep falling
room test/camera
spawn 5400 960
frames 200
input
  0..20 R
  50 R toss
  60 toss
end
expect
  at 50 event.toss=1
  at 60 event.teleport=1
end
